Complete Containerization Process 🔄

Let's take your College AI Assistant as an example.

Step 1: Create the application
FastAPI + Python
HTML + CSS + JavaScript
Step 2: Create requirements.txt

Example:

fastapi
uvicorn
google-genai

This defines the Python libraries your application needs.

Step 3: Create a Dockerfile

The Dockerfile contains instructions for packaging the application.

Application Code
       +
requirements.txt
       +
Dockerfile
       ↓
Docker Build 🐳
       ↓
Docker Image 📦
       ↓
Docker Container 🚀
Step 4: Run the container

Now your application runs inside an isolated container.

Your Laptop / Cloud Server
        │
        └── 📦 College AI Assistant Container
                │
                ├── Python
                ├── FastAPI
                ├── Libraries
                └── Your Application
